---
// 3. ABOUT — true two-column, with the five-line drop cap.
---

<section class="about" id="sec-about">
  <div class="about-body">
    <p><span class="dropcap">D</span>r. Syreeta McClain is an accomplished educational leader, high school principal, consultant, speaker, and nonprofit co-founder with more than two decades of experience transforming the lives of young people and the systems that serve them. She specializes in customized high school programming, alternative education, student engagement, leadership development, and creating innovative pathways for student success. As the CEO of Premier Leadership, LLC, she provides leadership coaching, professional development, workshops, program development, and keynote presentations for educators, schools, organizations, parents, and community leaders.</p>
    <p>She is also the co-founder of the Everyday Legends Foundation, a nonprofit committed to strengthening communities grounded in their three pillars: education, athletics, and service. Drawing from her unique experience as an educator, executive leader, and nonprofit founder, Dr.&nbsp;McClain now bridges her skillsets with the evolving landscape of sports and NIL, as athletic manager to her sons, while empowering individuals and families to maximize their impact.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Hung off-axis: the left inset is roughly 2.4x the right, so the text
     block sits well right of the trim and never reads as a centred column. */
  .about{
    padding: clamp(128px, 19vw, 268px) var(--gutter) 0 var(--gutter-wide);
  }

  .about-body{
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0 auto 0 0;
    column-count: 2;
    column-gap: clamp(48px, 5.6vw, 88px);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--bio-size);
    line-height: var(--bio-lh);
    letter-spacing: 0.004em;
    color: var(--slate);
    text-align: left;
    text-wrap: pretty;      /* rag + widow control */
    orphans: 3;
    widows: 3;
  }

  .about-body p{ margin: 0; }
  .about-body p + p{ margin-top: 1.5em; }

  /* Drop cap — spans exactly 5 lines. Ink cap-height optically aligned to the
     cap height of line 1, ink baseline to the baseline of line 5.

     Re-solved for this pass: BOTH the body metrics (16.5/1.75 -> 17/1.8) and
     the drop cap's own axes (SOFT 0 -> 20, wght 400 -> 380) changed, and either
     alone invalidates the previous solve. Measured against actual rendered ink
     rather than assumed metrics: Montserrat cap-height 0.70000, Fraunces
     cap-height at these axes 0.69946 (not the 0.700 previously assumed).

       required ink cap-height = 4 x line-height + body cap-height
                               = 4(30.6) + 0.70000(17) = 134.30px
       font-size               = 134.30 / 0.69946 = 191.933px

     Verified on the rendered page: ink height 134.25px, cap-top error
     -0.006px, baseline error -0.056px. Solved separately at each breakpoint
     below, because the body type size changes there. */
  /* GOLD */
  .dropcap{
    float: left;
    font-family: var(--display);
    /* Drop cap tier — opsz 144, SOFT 20. Largest glyph on the page, so it sits
       at the top of the optical-size axis where the thick/thin contrast is
       greatest; SOFT 20 takes the hard edge off the terminals without
       surrendering that contrast. */
    font-variation-settings: var(--fx-dropcap);
    font-weight: 380;
    font-size: 191.933px;
    line-height: 0.64787;              /* box 124.347px; float bottom lands in line 5 */
    color: var(--gold);
    margin: 0.069571em 0.042em 0 0;    /* top 13.353px — drops the ink cap top
                                          onto the line-1 cap top */
    padding: 0;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px){
    .about{
      padding: clamp(96px, 18vw, 148px) var(--gutter) 0;
    }
    .about-body{
      column-count: 1;
      max-width: 62ch;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px){
    .dropcap{
      /* Re-solved independently for the 16px/1.74 mobile body:
           4(27.84) + 0.70000(16) = 122.56px ink cap-height
           122.56 / 0.69948 = 175.129px
         Verified: ink height 122.50px, cap-top error -0.003px,
         baseline error -0.063px. */
      font-size: 175.129px;
      line-height: 0.6451;         /* box 112.976px */
      margin-top: 0.07026em;       /* 12.304px */
      margin-right: 0.040em;
    }
  }
</style>
